    "rounds": [
        {
            "id": "65459798-324d-4943-bf68-9b15c56d09d6",
            "build_id": "2080e53e-e3a1-4cd8-8126-ccb33cd0ef52",
            "round_number": 1,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-30T16:33:36.738589+00:00",
            "notes": "[Legendary Loadout](item_81067d34-38fb-4057-9336-f387f75dfd5f) makes Micro Missiles way more effective at bursting down targets while adding a substantial amount of splash, this build is designed to take maximum advantage of this Power.\n\nOptionally,  [Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7) enables us to convert our high burst damage into healing.\n\nPlaystyle: Your main goal with this build is to find eliminations on squishy targets (DPS and Supports) closing the distance with your Booster Jets and eliminating them with Micro Missiles. An important part of finding success with your dives is going to involve correct routing and avoiding damage when initiating, keeping your armor up before you engage guarantees much more survivability and avoids remechs. \n\nYou DO NOT want to be brawling with the enemy tank with this build, instead find off angles or high ground you can set up on and then utilize your mobility as Dva to jump on vulnerable squishy targets. Identify which heroes on the enemy team are especially susceptible to your damage. AKA Ana (DM her cooldowns and missile to death), Juno (very little sustain when you close the distance), Cassidy (little to no movement abilities to escape your dive) etc. \n\nIf a Reinhardt is swinging his hammer on you, you are in the WRONG place.\n\nIf a Zarya is beaming you, you are in the WRONG place.\n\nIf you are boosting to Soldier 76, Defense Matrixing his Visor and peppering him with Missiles, you are in the RIGHT place. \n\nIf you are Defense Matrixing Ana's nade and hitting her with  [Legendary Loadout](item_81067d34-38fb-4057-9336-f387f75dfd5f) missiles, you are in the RIGHT place.",
