            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-30T16:33:36.738589+00:00",
            "notes": "[Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56)  and  [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) start ramping our Micro Missile damage, squishy enemies who do not invest in armor or survivability are now VERY vulnerable to you.\n\n[Plot Armor](item_d1427316-79d1-43a7-a608-67beb1595131) is an OPTIONAL part of the build. Some D.Vas have a hard time into the Zarya matchup but frankly on D.Va you should almost never be within range of a Zarya beam. Play different angles and high grounds from the Zarya and do not engage her, this build is meant to dive the backline or secure kills on isolated DPS. Deal with them first then address Zarya.\n\n[Refraction Armor](item_dd020802-8d00-489d-93e0-930b80e31144) is a cheaper option to mitigate beam damage if you find you absolutely need it.",
