            "notes": "[Overstocked](item_d6b946fd-0fd8-4ba1-85d0-601995136eb6) gives us more Micro Missile charges. With where our ability power is at this point in the match, there are very few non tanks that are able to survive two barrages of Micro Missiles.\n\nSelling  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) usually allows you to pick   [Onslaught Ordinance](item_aa2a5d6d-0f8f-4b27-a44e-331832ec11fa)  at this point but there are ways to mix and match commons to best fit our budget at this point. \n\n[Mastermind\u2019s Mitigator](item_ed05519f-24f7-456a-8a3a-cdc145a7250d) also deserves a shout for reducing your Missile cooldown but it is optional and matchup dependent.\n\nThere are multiple Survival options to boost your defenses if needed however, in my experience keeping your ability power high to make your dives more lethal is the stronger playstyle. If you find yourself taking so much damage you are most likely taking too much aggro pre-dive or routing incorrectly. Be mindful of your approach to each engagement and being healthy prior to boosting at a squishy target.",
