            "created_at": "2025-07-30T16:33:36.738589+00:00",
            "notes": "Dropping our green Common items leans further into our Micro Missiles deleting enemy backlines. If you are short on money mix and match to see what fits. \n\n[Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) deserves mention for being a cheaper cost at bumping ability power, opening up room for some survivability items such as  [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) or  [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016). If you can live without the additionally survivability, opt out. If you find yourself getting demeched too often option into some more sturdiness.\n\nReminder to check the Optional Items section in case your economy is better or worse than the baseline the build has set.",
