            "notes": "Entering the endgame, both teams start hitting the overinflated stat portion of the game.  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) allows us to reel in some of that stat bloat by reducing healing to targets we missile, making it easier to secure kills on the second charge of Micro Missiles. \n\nIf huge healing numbers by the enemy team haven't been causing you issues, I would advice forgoing  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) for  [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) as an all around boost. \n\nOptionally,  [Macro Missile](item_55f86238-d6d9-4419-9461-ca7c619c2f66) leans further into pumping up our missile damage. Take what works for you but be aware of how the knockback makes it more difficult to secure constant burst damage.\n\nKeep an eye on Optional Items as your economy may change depending on how well or poorly previous rounds have gone. There are options for both survivability and more ability power.",
